| Arm | Model / init | Frame (HAA) | Pretraining | HAA fine-tuning (seeds 0,1,2) + zero-shot | Sim k = 0 eval |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| A `control` | SimpleViT, exp_01 `ckpt/xRIR_simple_8_shot/epoch_12.pth` | room | exists | **exists** (exp_02, `ckpt/sim2real/control/`) | **exists** (exp_04 `ckpt/yaw_aug/eval/control_k8_seed{42..46}_k0/`, reused via §6.4) |
